HedgeGuard.extruction
├── when either swap amount is zero
│   └── it should revert with AmountsNotComputed
└── when both swap amounts are computed
    ├── given no target is set for the maker
    │   └── it should revert with TargetNotSet
    └── given a target is set
        ├── given the target has expired
        │   └── it should revert with TargetExpired
        └── given the target has not expired
            ├── when the token pair is not the allowed direction
            │   └── it should revert with WrongDirection
            └── when the token pair is the allowed direction
                ├── when the BTC size is above the remaining size
                │   └── it should revert with SizeExceedsRemaining
                └── when the BTC size is within the remaining size
                    ├── when the implied price is outside the band
                    │   └── it should revert with PriceOutsideBand
                    └── when the implied price is inside the band
                        ├── given the feed answer is not positive
                        │   └── it should revert with OracleInvalid
                        ├── given the feed is older than the max age
                        │   └── it should revert with OracleStale
                        └── given the feed is fresh
                            ├── when the price is further from the feed than the max deviation
                            │   └── it should revert with PriceFarFromOracle
                            └── when the price is within the max deviation
                                ├── given a static call (quote)
                                │   └── it should return the registers unchanged and write nothing
                                └── given a swap call
                                    ├── given the caller is not the router
                                    │   └── it should revert with OnlyRouter
                                    └── given the caller is the router
                                        └── it should return the registers unchanged, decrement remaining and emit HedgeFilled
